con.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Opportunity Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><b>Opportunity Attack</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Attack an enemy moving out of reach.</p></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Technical</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>S_LOW_DeadAdventurer_002</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_DeadAdventurer_002+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_DeadAdventurer_002+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>91949015-b599-4e1b-9ef1-844d4d969753</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:91949015-b599-4e1b-9ef1-844d4d969753\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:91949015-b599-4e1b-9ef1-844d4d969753\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>Halfling_Ranger</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Halfling_Ranger+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Halfling_Ranger+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Dead Halfling</b> is a character in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City_Sewers\" title=\"Lower City Sewers\">Lower City Sewers</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>. \n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\">Act Three</span></h3>\n<p>Dead Halfling is a dead adventurer whose corpse is in the antechamber of the <a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_Lair\" title=\"Ancient Lair\">Ancient Lair</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Undercity_Ruins\" title=\"Undercity Ruins\">Undercity Ruins</a> together with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Human_(Fighter,_Ancient_Lair)\" title=\"Dead Human (Fighter, Ancient Lair)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Fighter%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png/25px-Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Fighter%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Fighter%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png/38px-Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Fighter%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Fighter%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png/50px-Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Fighter%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dead Human (Fighter)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Fighter%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png/25px-Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Fighter%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Fighter%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Human_(Fighter,_Ancient_Lair)\" title=\"Dead Human (Fighter, Ancient Lair)\">Dead Human (Fighter)</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Human_(Wizard,_Ancient_Lair)\" title=\"Dead Human (Wizard, Ancient Lair)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Wizard%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png/25px-Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Wizard%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Wizard%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png/38px-Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Wizard%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Wizard%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png/50px-Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Wizard%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dead Human (Wizard)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Wizard%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png/25px-Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Wizard%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Portrait_Dead_Human_%28Wizard%2C_Ancient_Lair%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Human_(Wizard,_Ancient_Lair)\" title=\"Dead Human (Wizard, Ancient Lair)\">Dead Human (Wizard)</a>. They apparently discovered the Ancient Lair, belonging to the dreadful mummy lord <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Carrion\" title=\"Mystic Carrion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/25px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/38px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/50px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mystic Carrion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png/25px-Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Mystic_Carrion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Carrion\" title=\"Mystic Carrion\">Mystic Carrion</a> and lost their lives to the protective curse and the multiple undead guarding the lair.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Loot\">Loot</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Leather_Armour\" title=\"Leather Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/Leather_Armour_3_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Leather_Armour\" title=\"Leather Armour\">Leather Armour</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Longbow\" title=\"Longbow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Longbow_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longbow_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Longbow_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Longbow_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Longbow_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Longbow_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Longbow_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longbow_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Longbow_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Longbow\" title=\"Longbow\">Longbow</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes_and_references\">Notes and references</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}